===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|Cōnstantīnus}}, the name of Roman emperors, notably that of [[w:Constantine the Great|Constantine the Great]], {{uder|en|la|cōnstāns||constant, steadfast}}. {{doublet|en|Konstadinos}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɒns.tənˌtaɪn/|a=UK}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɑns.tənˌtiːn/|a=US}}

